---
import "@app/styles/global.css";
---

<section id="about" class="py-16 md:py-24 container mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6">
    <div
        class="about-card relative isolate w-full rounded-2xl md:rounded-3xl overflow-hidden border border-zinc-200 px-6 sm:px-10 md:px-14 lg:px-20 py-20 md:py-28"
    >
        <div class="about-dots" aria-hidden="true"></div>
        <div
            class="max-w-4xl mx-auto flex flex-col gap-8 md:gap-12 text-center relative z-10"
        >
            <h2
                data-about-heading
                class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl md:text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-semibold leading-tight md:leading-[1.15] tracking-tight text-zinc-800 opacity-0"
            >
                ¿Por qué existimos?
            </h2>
            <p
                data-about-body
                class="text-base sm:text-lg md:text-xl text-zinc-600 leading-relaxed max-w-3xl mx-auto opacity-0"
            >
                Porque la mayoría de las agencias venden software que los
                equipos nunca llegan a operar. Eso no resuelve problemas, los
                disfraza. <span
                    class="font-semibold text-emerald-900 relative inline-block px-1.5 py-0.5 sm:px-2 sm:py-1"
                    ><span
                        class="absolute inset-0 bg-emerald-200/60 -rotate-1 transform origin-center rounded-sm -mx-1"
                    ></span><span class="relative z-10"
                        >Sync existe para hacer lo opuesto.</span
                    ></span
                > Entendemos la operación real, educamos al equipo sobre sus cuellos
                de botella, y entregamos soluciones hechas para que tu equipo las
                opere — con mantenimiento continuo de nuestro lado.
            </p>
        </div>
    </div>

    <p
        data-about-quote
        class="mt-6 md:mt-8 max-w-3xl text-sm text-zinc-500 leading-relaxed text-left opacity-0"
    >
        <span class="italic"
            >"Empezamos Sync porque nos cansamos de ver agencias entregar software,
            y equipos que nunca aprendieron a operarlo."</span
        >
        <span class="text-zinc-400"> — </span>
        <span class="font-medium text-emerald-900">Yamil Yscapa</span>,
        Co-fundador
    </p>

    <script>
        import { animate, inView } from "framer-motion";

        const prefersReducedMotion = window.matchMedia(
            "(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)",
        ).matches;

        const heading = document.querySelector<HTMLElement>(
            "[data-about-heading]",
        );
        const body = document.querySelector<HTMLElement>("[data-about-body]");

        const fadeIn = (el: HTMLElement | null, y = 20, duration = 0.6) => {
            if (!el) return;
            if (prefersReducedMotion) {
                el.style.opacity = "1";
                return;
            }
            inView(
                el,
                () => {
                    animate(
                        el,
                        {
                            opacity: [0, 1],
                            transform: [
                                `translateY(${y}px)`,
                                "translateY(0px)",
                            ],
                        },
                        { duration, ease: [0.22, 1, 0.36, 1] },
                    );
                },
                { amount: 0.3 },
            );
        };

        const quote = document.querySelector<HTMLElement>("[data-about-quote]");

        fadeIn(heading, 24);
        fadeIn(body, 16);
        fadeIn(quote, 20, 0.7);
    </script>

    <style>
        .about-card {
            position: relative;
        }

        .about-dots {
            position: absolute;
            inset: 0;
            pointer-events: none;
            z-index: 0;
            background-image: radial-gradient(
                circle,
                rgba(4, 120, 87, 0.7) 0.9px,
                transparent 1.2px
            );
            background-size: 13px 13px;
            opacity: 0.4;
        }

        @media (min-width: 640px) {
            .about-dots {
                background-image: radial-gradient(
                    circle,
                    rgba(4, 120, 87, 0.7) 1.2px,
                    transparent 1.6px
                );
                background-size: 18px 18px;
            }
        }

        @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
            [data-about-heading],
            [data-about-body],
            [data-about-quote] {
                opacity: 1 !important;
            }
        }
    </style>
</section>
